ue pi-font\">4.0<br/><span class=\"implementation-date\">May 20, 1998<br/>Beta 4.0</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\">See also: Objects<span class=\"explained\">Help</span></nav>\n</aside>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-intro\">\n<div id=\"w-object-profile\">\n<div id=\"w-twbox-image\"><img alt=\"latest?cb=20050605194944&amp;path-prefix=en&amp;format=original\" class=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Might_Ring_729ae6.gif\"/></div>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-look\"><div class=\"item-look tibiatext tibiagreen\">You see a might ring <span class=\"p-attributes\">(protection physical +20%, fire +20%, earth +20%, energy +20%, ice +20%, holy +20%, death +20%)</span> <span class=\"p-charges\">that has 20 charges left</span>.<div class=\"p-weight\">It weighs 1.00 oz.</div><br/></div></div>\n<div class=\"\" id=\"w-twbox-sounds\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-object-notes\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Notes\">Notes</span></h3>\n<p>The damage reduction is 20%, rounded <b>up</b> to the nearest whole number.\n</p><p>You can obtain one through the <a href=\"#/quest/ornamented-shield-quest\">Ornamented Shield Quest</a> or as a reward from the Lightbearer event when 10 basins are lit.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div class=\"history-section\" id=\"w-object-history\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-History\">History</span></h3>\n<ul><li>Before the 2007 Winter Update, it only provided 25% protection against fire, poison, energy, and physical damage.</li>\n<li>The price was changed from 5,000 to 25,000 with the 2024 Summer Update.</li></ul>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-item-droppedby\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Dropped_By\">Dropped By</span></h3>\n<div class=\"item-droppedby-wrapper\">\n<ul><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Angry%20Demon\">Angry Demon</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Ashmunrah\">Ashmunrah</a></li>\n<li><a href=